LanguageData.BOR_PsychosisGizmoTip:
Psychosis: {0} ({1})
Work limit: {2}

Once psychosis reaches the limit, this colonist stops working tenebrite benches, research benches, forges and the dark altar. They can return once it falls below the limit. Drag the bar to set the limit. At 100% there is no limit.

LanguageData.BOR_AltarLockedTip:
{0}

Sealed. Click to have a psychotic colonist unseal it ({1} of work). Click again to cancel.

Once unsealed: yield per run {2}, crystalline joints per run {3}.

LanguageData.BOR_AltarCellTip:
{0}

Yield per run: {1}
Crystalline joints per run: {2}

Left click: queue 1 (Shift: 5)
Right click: remove 1 (Shift: 5)

